{"bvid": "BV1xb411v7Xq", "title": "超详细！几分钟就学会的英语精听方法！考试高分不是梦！", "duration": 4142, "subs": [{"cid": 80031154, "lan": "ai-zh", "n": 355, "body": [{"from": 0.34, "to": 0.88, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "哇大家好"}, {"from": 0.88, "to": 1.54, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "我是俊"}, {"from": 1.54, "to": 2.8, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "今天给大家分享一下"}, {"from": 2.8, "to": 5.59, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "英语当中最有效的听力练习方法之一"}, {"from": 5.59, "to": 6.4, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "就是精听"}, {"from": 6.4, "to": 8.15, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "也就是我们常说的听力听写"}, {"from": 8.15, "to": 8.69, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "哎呦妈呀"}, {"from": 8.69, "to": 9.41, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "这贼简单的"}, {"from": 9.41, "to": 10.01, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "一学就会"}, {"from": 10.01, "to": 11.84, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "别忘了把我扔进你的收藏夹里"}, {"from": 11.84, "to": 12.65, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "可能现在用不上"}, {"from": 12.65, "to": 13.97, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "唯一哪天用上了呢对吧"}, {"from": 13.97, "to": 14.69, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "废话不多说"}, {"from": 14.69, "to": 15.77, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "废话又说了很多"}, {"from": 15.77, "to": 17.5, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "那我们就开始吧"}, {"from": 17.919, "to": 20.229, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "第一步准备一张纸"}, {"from": 20.229, "to": 21.369, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "还有一支笔"}, {"from": 21.369, "to": 21.699, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "诶"}, {"from": 21.699, "to": 22.299, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "你怎么说的"}, {"from": 22.299, "to": 23.91, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "不是你一支笔"}, {"from": 23.91, "to": 24.39, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "当然了"}, {"from": 24.39, "to": 26.55, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "你用软件或者用应用也是可以的"}, {"from": 26.55, "to": 29.1, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "在这呢我良心推荐一下阿波波这个软件呃"}, {"from": 29.1, "to": 29.88, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "这个不是推广啊"}, {"from": 29.88, "to": 31.23, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "反正我讲拓扑课的时候"}, {"from": 31.23, "to": 32.76, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "我都让学生用这个呃"}, {"from": 32.76, "to": 33.36, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "但是我个"}, {"from": 33.36, "to": 34.75, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "人呢还是喜欢手写"}, {"from": 34.75, "to": 36.86, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "既简单又安心"}, {"from": 36.98, "to": 39.41, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "第二步选择一段听力的练习材料"}, {"from": 39.41, "to": 39.92, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "在这儿呢"}, {"from": 39.92, "to": 41.98, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "特别给大家说一下几个需要注意的地方"}, {"from": 41.98, "to": 43.36, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "第一就是对于你而言"}, {"from": 43.36, "to": 44.08, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "速度过快"}, {"from": 44.08, "to": 45.76, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "难度过高的一律淘汰掉"}, {"from": 45.76, "to": 47.44, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "并不是别人听bbc voa"}, {"from": 47.44, "to": 48.34, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "你也一定要听"}, {"from": 48.34, "to": 49.0, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "一般而言"}, {"from": 49.0, "to": 51.34, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "能听懂至少70%左右的材料"}, {"from": 51.34, "to": 52.9, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "做精听就比较合适了"}, {"from": 52.9, "to": 53.92, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "既可以理解大意"}, {"from": 53.92, "to": 55.75, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "不会因为太难而失去信心"}, {"from": 55.75, "to": 57.13, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "又能学到新的东西"}, {"from": 57.13, "to": 58.69, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "想当年我做精听的时候"}, {"from": 58.69, "to": 59.29, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "一开始不懂"}, {"from": 59.29, "to": 61.18, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "一上来就听v o a的常驻新闻"}, {"from": 61.18, "to": 64.03, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "把自己虐的体无完肤的正确率听写下来"}, {"from": 64.03, "to": 65.67, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "连50%都不到啊"}, {"from": 65.67, "to": 66.39, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "当时也挺过"}, {"